Dialogue: 2,0:02:31.45,0:02:36.42,Title,,0,0,230,,{\bord0\blur0.6\fad(800,600)\4a&HFF&}Gray Terminal
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.78,0:02:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The path that led Luffy to\NMarineford began long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.76,0:02:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten years ago, in fact, in the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.36,0:02:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There lies a small town known as Windmill\NVillage, where people lived quiet,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.46,0:02:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,peaceful lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.72,0:02:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it was the nearby Mount Grove\Nwhere few would dare to set foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.98,0:02:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For only the strong could\Nsurvive in its dark woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:03:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,faced with beasts that would\Nmake quick work of trespassers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.60,0:03:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with being king\Nof the pirates, Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.70,0:03:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pirates are cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what makes you think I care?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.64,0:03:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna slap you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.94,0:03:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eating that Devil Fruit\Nwasn't enough trouble for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.50,0:03:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now this nonsense, you and your big brother\NAce are going to become fine marines.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.78,0:03:22.05,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(500,0)\fnFOT-Greco Std B\b1\fs50\pos(641,717)\3c&H272A2E&\c&H272A2E&\1a&HFF&\t(455,500,\1a&H00&)}Monkey D. Garp\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N{\fnRoboto\fs45}(10 Years Ago)
Dialogue: 2,0:03:16.78,0:03:22.05,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\fad(500,0)\fnFOT-Greco Std B\b1\fs50\pos(641,717)\4a&HFF&}Monkey D. Garp\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N{\fnRoboto\fs45}(10 Years Ago)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.98,0:03:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.04,0:03:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, you suck!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.05,0:03:26.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(500,0)\fnFOT-Greco Std B\b1\fs50\pos(640,717)\3c&H31383F&\c&H31383F&\1a&HFF&\t(455,500,\1a&H00&)}Monkey D. Luffy\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N{\fnRoboto\fs45}(10 Years Ago)
Dialogue: 2,0:03:22.05,0:03:26.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\fad(500,0)\fnFOT-Greco Std B\b1\fs50\pos(640,717)\4a&HFF&}Monkey D. Luffy\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N{\fnRoboto\fs45}(10 Years Ago)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.92,0:03:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I was supposed to\Nbe made out of rubber now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.26,0:03:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does this still hurt so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.52,0:03:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought leaving you in a nice\Nvillage would keep you safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.76,0:03:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but pirates won't be satisfied until they\Nget their grubby hands on everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.70,0:03:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.10,0:03:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.48,0:03:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is you're\Nselling, I don't want knives!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.36,0:03:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.36,0:03:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garp, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.81,0:03:58.28,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(500,0)\fnFOT-Greco Std B\fs50\b1\3c&H212326&\c&H222528&\1a&HFF&\t(455,500,\1a&H00&)}Curly Dadan
Dialogue: 2,0:03:54.81,0:03:58.28,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\fad(500,0)\fnFOT-Greco Std B\fs50\b1\4a&HFF&}Curly Dadan
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.28,0:04:01.72,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(520,0)\fnFOT-Greco Std B\fs50\b1\3c&H202224&\c&H222528&\1a&HFF&\t(475,520,\1a&H00&)}{MOUNTAIN BANDIT: DOGRA}Dogra, a Mountain Bandit
Dialogue: 2,0:03:58.28,0:04:01.72,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\fad(520,0)\fnFOT-Greco Std B\fs50\b1\4a&HFF&}{MOUNTAIN BANDIT: DOGRA}Dogra, a Mountain Bandit
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.72,0:04:05.19,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(520,0)\fnFOT-Greco Std B\fs50\b1\3c&H1E1F21&\c&H222528&\1a&HFF&\t(475,520,\1a&H00&)}{MOUNTAIN BANDIT: MAGRA}Magra, a Mountain Bandit
Dialogue: 2,0:04:01.72,0:04:05.19,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\fad(520,0)\fnFOT-Greco Std B\fs50\b1\4a&HFF&}{MOUNTAIN BANDIT: MAGRA}Magra, a Mountain Bandit
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.42,0:04:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Charming as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.86,0:04:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the cold welcome,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.42,0:04:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I hope you don't have another\Nridiculous favor to ask us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You realize Ace is already ten, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.88,0:04:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.46,0:04:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how's the little scam doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.93,0:04:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there's a handful, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.46,0:04:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we've been watching over\Nthe brat for long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.28,0:04:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So just take him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.64,0:04:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.62,0:04:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.92,0:04:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.94,0:04:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of brat, would\Nyou shut that one up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.10,0:04:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's yours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.30,0:04:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, tell him\Nhello. Yo! Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.48,0:04:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.96,0:04:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never heard about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.42,0:04:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you want us to take\Ncare of the little monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.80,0:04:49.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little darling, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.80,0:04:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, no way. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.72,0:04:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll give you two choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.24,0:04:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can either raise my grandson\Nor spend your life in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:05:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty generous, considering\Nall the crimes you've committed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.96,0:05:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.86,0:05:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is, I'd rather\Nstay out of the slammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frankly, if you ask me that\Non one of Ace's bad days,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.96,0:05:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might have to go for the\Nprison option after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.42,0:05:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And two breaths?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.33,0:05:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.88,0:05:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This kid looks like a real charmer, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.70,0:05:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.10,0:05:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanna fight, you\Nlittle punk? Hehehehe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.38,0:05:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.40,0:05:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.94,0:05:25.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.85,0:05:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ew! Spit! That's gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.36,0:05:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.88,0:05:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! You jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.08,0:05:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better apologize for\Nthat! Hey! There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.18,0:05:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello Ace! Welcome back!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.08,0:05:45.32,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(500,0)\fnFOT-Greco Std B\b1\fs50\pos(641,717)\3c&H222528&\c&H222528&\1a&HFF&\t(455,500,\1a&H00&)}Portgas D. Ace\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N{\fnRoboto\fs45}(10 Years Ago)
Dialogue: 2,0:05:41.08,0:05:45.32,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\fad(500,0)\fnFOT-Greco Std B\b1\fs50\pos(641,717)\4a&HFF&}Portgas D. Ace\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N{\fnRoboto\fs45}(10 Years Ago)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.44,0:05:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.18,0:05:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, this here is Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.32,0:05:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's three years older than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.38,0:05:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you're going to be living\Nwith him and Dadan from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:05:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.83,0:05:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.48,0:06:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You play nice. Ace, Tech!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.60,0:06:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, as you wish, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.68,0:06:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your turn to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.96,0:06:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man, can I have some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a woman, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.70,0:06:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you even know where you are\Nright now, you filthy little urchin?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.82,0:06:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.73,0:06:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the den of the Dadan family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.96,0:06:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mountain bandits that rule Mount Grove.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mountain bandits?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.34,0:06:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ball, mountain bandits are lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're stuck with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.72,0:06:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or rather, we're stuck with you thanks\Nto that pushy grandfather of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.40,0:06:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you don't want to\Nstay, that's fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, go get eaten by a bunch\Nof wolves for all I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.70,0:06:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy, boss, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.66,0:06:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanted some more rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meat would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.64,0:07:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case you didn't notice, all this meat\Ncame from that bison ace brought back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though he's a kid like you,\Nhe has to work to earn his cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.22,0:07:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bandit's life's a hard one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.28,0:07:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, you're gonna pay\Nin blood, sweat, and tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.80,0:07:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cleaning, doing laundry,\Npolishing our boots and weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.78,0:07:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,robbery, fraud, murder, and terror!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.48,0:07:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you go crying to\Nyour dear old grandpa,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.44,0:07:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll string you up\Nwithout a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.94,0:07:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One bowl of rice and one glass of\Nwater, that's all I can promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.22,0:07:30.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest you get for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.56,0:07:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna have to\Ngrow up real fast, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.12,0:07:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or you're gonna go hungry\Nbefore the week's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.18,0:07:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem. No problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.06,0:07:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not crying and begging for mercy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.36,0:07:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandpa threw me in the jungle one time,\Nso I know how to tough it out just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.26,0:07:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's plenty of water to drink,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.74,0:07:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I can eat frogs and snakes and\Nmushrooms and stuff all I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.46,0:07:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be a pirate someday,\Nso we gotta be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.86,0:07:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be real fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss! You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.30,0:07:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, help her up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.58,0:08:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep home!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.98,0:08:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why's he leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.22,0:08:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.72,0:08:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, get back here, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.44,0:08:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, what do you mean\Nyou're gonna be a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AND STOP IGNORING ME!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.04,0:08:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.62,0:08:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just got here and he's already a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.18,0:08:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be like having\Na baby Garp living with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.06,0:08:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.36,0:08:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.64,0:08:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.72,0:08:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.63,0:08:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's cool now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.32,0:08:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not mad about you spitting on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.62,0:08:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you all laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.70,0:08:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the guy just spilled some booze on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.06,0:08:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not worth getting bent out of shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.32,0:08:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not worth getting bent out of shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.32,0:08:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.30,0:08:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So can I come with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.54,0:09:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.76,0:10:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what that means! Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.59,0:10:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.90,0:10:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.38,0:10:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.76,0:10:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it he with you? Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.60,0:10:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a hold of yourself. This\Nis serious. No biggie. Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.94,0:10:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what is that what you're\Ngonna say to garp when he
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.78,0:10:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,finds out we let his\Ngrandson die why do you care
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.40,0:10:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one less crappy brat in the\Nworld you know what while
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.26,0:10:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're at it screw ace\Ntwo if he dies we'll tell
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.38,0:10:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,garp it was an accident i\Nmean that'd be the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.54,0:10:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wouldn't it the devil's\Nchildren have the devil's luck
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.74,0:10:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about that? Cause Ace\Nis the devil's son for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.82,0:10:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think the government\Nwould do if they found out about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.46,0:10:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.37,0:10:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take my chances with Garp.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.02,0:10:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you don't mean that, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.64,0:10:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, that's the booze talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.86,0:10:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just sleep it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.68,0:11:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One week later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.84,0:11:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.10,0:11:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come here, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.66,0:11:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.18,0:11:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.16,0:11:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The little bugger isn't dead after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.18,0:11:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're alive
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.44,0:11:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you scare us like that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.88,0:11:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy, easy, boss Where the hell\Nwere you and what were you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.66,0:11:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now, just give him a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.36,0:11:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll answer without\Nall the face stretching!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.28,0:11:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was stuck in the bottom of the valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.54,0:11:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting chased by wolves?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.12,0:11:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.40,0:11:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck were you\Ntrying to do down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.34,0:11:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever. It's\Ngood you came back safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing good about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another useless mouth to feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.84,0:11:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get some sleep while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.72,0:11:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're putting you to work\Nbright and early tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.74,0:12:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.24,0:12:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You going somewhere fun today? Take me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.90,0:12:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I was gone for a while,\NBut I still want to be friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.56,0:12:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.66,0:12:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss, he's running after Ace again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.46,0:12:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.80,0:12:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.00,0:12:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still have chores to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.10,0:12:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.78,0:12:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am gonna wring your\Nrotten neck, you twerp!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.20,0:12:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.11,0:12:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.03,0:12:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shut your yapper\Nand go bring him back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.98,0:12:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.86,0:12:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the same thing every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.86,0:13:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that didn't deter him one bit. Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.50,0:13:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A month passed, two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.70,0:13:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the rain or in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.28,0:13:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's make friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.52,0:13:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace would run and Luffy would chase him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:34.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.38,0:13:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not giving up yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm having a tough time losing\Nhim today, stubborn punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.62,0:13:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.98,0:13:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.89,0:13:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.81,0:13:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got away again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.06,0:13:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd he get so darn fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.98,0:14:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, there you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.30,0:14:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's got to be the nastiest\Nmonster in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.34,0:14:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even I can't beat that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.70,0:14:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run away, stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.06,0:14:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to eat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.88,0:14:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to run away, but my\Nlegs won't let me. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.74,0:14:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.52,0:14:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.56,0:14:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm... Ah
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.90,0:14:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-ha
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.44,0:14:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.18,0:15:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.06,0:15:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.30,0:15:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah-ha-ha! Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.20,0:15:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.40,0:15:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three months had passed, and although\Nhe was covered with cuts and bruises,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.74,0:15:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy did not relish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.72,0:15:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the edge of the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.38,0:15:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the north side of Mount Grove,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.84,0:15:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not far from where Dedan's bandits live,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.54,0:16:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there is a surprise at\Nthe end of the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.24,0:16:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Covered in a thick mist, piles of\Ntrash reach toward the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.16,0:16:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a place where the unwanted gather.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.66,0:16:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That goes for the refuse, as\Nwell as those who reside there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.44,0:16:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rogues cast out by society.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.70,0:16:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a den of lawlessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.98,0:16:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crime and disease run rampant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.52,0:16:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With neither marines nor doctors present.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.28,0:16:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is known as Gray Terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.42,0:16:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a bunch of junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.32,0:16:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta be something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.14,0:16:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.86,0:16:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.42,0:16:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.33,0:16:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.25,0:16:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Torque it over!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.16,0:16:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.07,0:16:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.99,0:16:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.90,0:16:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.81,0:16:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna break it, you idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.20,0:16:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's cool, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.11,0:16:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanna cash it in for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.10,0:16:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.16,0:16:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, just give me one pearl!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.38,0:16:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.30,0:17:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can only blame yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.00,0:17:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, let's try this\Nwithout all the running.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.58,0:17:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look what I found!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.54,0:17:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.76,0:17:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.40,0:17:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it, you brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.86,0:17:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want some of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.70,0:17:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He went that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.84,0:17:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Samo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.75,0:17:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.14,0:17:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what's up, Ace?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.84,0:17:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm a little late this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.74,0:17:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More than a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.98,0:17:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I went out there and made\Na killing already today.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.75,0:17:51.29,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(500,0)\fnFOT-Greco Std B\b1\fs50\pos(654,716)\3c&H1A1B1E&\c&H1A1B1E&\1a&HFF&\t(455,500,\1a&H00&)}Sabo   {\fnRoboto\fs45}(Age 10{ YEARS OLD})\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N{\fs40}(A Boy Living in Gray Terminal)
Dialogue: 2,0:17:46.75,0:17:51.29,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\fad(500,0)\fnFOT-Greco Std B\b1\fs50\pos(654,716)\c&HFDFBFE&\4a&HFF&}Sabo   {\fnRoboto\fs45}(Age 10{ YEARS OLD})\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N{\fs40}(A Boy Living in Gray Terminal)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.94,0:17:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.28,0:17:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe I did, too. Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.98,0:17:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.72,0:17:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got more than me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.68,0:18:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a ton of cash. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.72,0:18:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some chumps near the gate, robbed\Nthem blind and made a run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.84,0:18:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.30,0:18:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess you win again, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if you win or lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.16,0:18:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got five years of\Npirate savings piled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.48,0:18:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should both be happy about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.44,0:18:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We worked pretty hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.08,0:18:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.74,0:18:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll leave this stump behind and go\Nplaces these chumps never even dreamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.44,0:18:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all gonna be\Nworth it. Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.08,0:18:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd better put it away now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.82,0:18:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let anyone else see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.76,0:18:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how much is a ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.36,0:18:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want a good one, but it\Nseems like we're pretty rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.28,0:18:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, could take ten million.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.02,0:18:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't rush it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.93,0:18:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.00,0:18:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.92,0:19:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you've got hidden treasure already?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.32,0:19:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be a pirate too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.80,0:19:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.28,0:19:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know what's cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.64,0:19:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I know where you go,\NI can follow you every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.62,0:19:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.32,0:19:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.62,0:19:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the brat you were talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.34,0:19:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you told\Nyour friends about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.58,0:19:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was telling my friend\Nhow annoying you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.26,0:19:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He also told me that your\Nhead's full of rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.56,0:19:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Head rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.76,0:19:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do realize we're messing\Nwith you here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.48,0:19:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The route I took here\Nwasn't easy to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.24,0:19:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew he was hard-headed, but\NI didn't think he was so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.66,0:19:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So great that Ace has other friends, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.20,0:19:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet we're all gonna be best pals!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.00,0:19:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not your pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.48,0:19:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't even know my name, stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.62,0:19:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then what is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.62,0:19:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's, uh, a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.88,0:20:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.58,0:20:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.92,0:20:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mountains made you tough, but at this\Nrate, our whole plan's gonna be ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.78,0:20:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.54,0:20:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knows our secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.28,0:20:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't trust him to keep his mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.98,0:20:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.18,0:20:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.44,0:20:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.24,0:20:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop, this is scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.78,0:20:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.60,0:20:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.04,0:20:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a break, this kid is the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.26,0:20:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just kill him already, hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.38,0:20:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's your problem. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.42,0:20:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I've never killed\Nanyone before, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.84,0:20:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, neither have I!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.12,0:20:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how this crap works!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just don't throw me in the\Nwater, I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.52,0:20:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, the river!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.02,0:20:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's convenient, but\Nwhy did he say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.44,0:20:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, he's stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.66,0:20:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.12,0:20:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.66,0:21:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.14,0:21:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.18,0:21:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just heard some screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.86,0:21:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son of a kid! Ah, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.74,0:21:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody hurt him! Set him free.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.02,0:21:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta get out of here and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.58,0:21:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If people start snooping around,\Nthey'll find our treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.60,0:21:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you're talking\Nabout Ace and Sabo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.10,0:21:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two are infamous around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.38,0:21:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the one who took your money.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.68,0:21:28.34,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(600,0)\fnFOT-Greco Std B\b1\fs50\pos(636.889,715.778)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(555,600,\1a&H00&)}{Bluejam Pirates\N\3c&H1A1B1E&\c&H1A1B1E&}{Sailor - }Porchemy\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N{\fnRoboto\fs45}Bluejam Pirates
Dialogue: 2,0:21:23.68,0:21:28.34,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\fad(600,0)\fnFOT-Greco Std B\b1\fs50\pos(636.889,715.778)\4a&HFF&}{Bluejam Pirates\N}{Sailor - }Porchemy\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N{\fnRoboto\fs45}Bluejam Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.54,0:21:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was Ace, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.76,0:21:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kid who had the black hair, you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.64,0:21:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.55,0:21:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is real pathetic, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.26,0:21:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We both got sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.80,0:21:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's either cocky or dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.92,0:21:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't rob pirates blind\Nand expect to get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.22,0:21:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bottom line is, if we\Ndon't get that money back?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.60,0:21:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Blue Jam's gonna skin us alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.54,0:21:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I mean literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.40,0:21:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blue Jam? Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.40,0:21:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How was I supposed to know\Nthey were working with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You robbed those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.48,0:21:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to get us killed or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.52,0:21:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is not gonna end well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.74,0:22:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sword looks sharp, though\Nyou probably saw that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.20,0:22:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guy with him is porching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.38,0:22:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.46,0:22:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lose a fight with him, and he'll scalp\Nyou alive just to hear you scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.52,0:22:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just lay low and let him pass by for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.60,0:22:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.74,0:22:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better put me down right now, you\Nbig - How did you get caught already?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.66,0:22:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.48,0:22:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy won't put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.16,0:22:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.80,0:22:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace, why aren't you saving me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.60,0:22:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.51,0:22:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should have killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.94,0:22:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we're all dead. Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.06,0:22:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you know Ace, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.42,0:22:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.48,0:22:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you cry, do you\Nthink he'll come for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.86,0:22:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, because we're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.54,0:22:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except he just tried to\Nkill me, so maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.36,0:22:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.27,0:22:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.46,0:23:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's your friend,\Nmaybe you can help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.00,0:23:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, Ace stole our money.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.52,0:23:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if we got it back, we\Nwouldn't have to hurt anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.02,0:23:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't happen to know\Nwhere it is, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.42,0:23:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.72,0:23:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna take our treasure\Nfor sure for once in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.54,0:23:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please shut up
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.16,0:23:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a crappy lawyer?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.32,0:23:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right fine, I'm sure you just forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.78,0:23:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I have ways\Nof jogging your memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.38,0:23:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.20,0:23:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me, you dumb jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.14,0:23:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna kick your\Nbutt, I'm telling you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.44,0:23:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a big jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.98,0:23:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.62,0:24:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop asking me, you know what!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.66,0:24:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.40,0:24:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not telling you a dark thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.44,0:24:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.36,0:24:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Gum-Gum fruit turned me into rubber,\Nso that stuff's not going to work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.76,0:24:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.38,0:24:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Devil Fruit, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.62,0:24:48.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.94,0:24:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know how to deal with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.34,0:24:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring me my pair of gloves.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.12,0:24:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.72,0:24:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, man! Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.40,0:25:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're screwed if those guys come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.18,0:25:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta move all this,\Nbut I don't know where.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.60,0:25:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy's pretty stubborn, but it's only\Na matter of time before he rats us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.14,0:25:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not losing our pirate savings\Nto those jerks or anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.74,0:25:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took us five years to score all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.96,0:25:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't get stuck in this dump forever
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.06,0:25:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try to clear this up a little the\Nmoney a stole isn't just some chump
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.40,0:25:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a matter of life and death\Nfor me and all of my buddies here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.94,0:25:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you're gonna tell me where it is
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.36,0:25:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I gotta beat it out of you
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.20,0:25:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.84,0:25:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.76,0:25:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.16,0:25:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't piss off a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.98,0:25:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't kick your ass, Captain Blue\NJam's gonna kill you and all of us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.74,0:26:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.98,0:26:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're hurting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.94,0:26:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody help!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.22,0:26:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to\Nstand around, you idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.78,0:26:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go look for Ace and Sabo\Nwhile I take care of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.66,0:26:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.98,0:26:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace and Sabo, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.68,0:26:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.10,0:26:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.40,0:26:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're from the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.56,0:26:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave those two be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.06,0:26:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you were locals, you'd understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.54,0:26:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They may be kids, but they're also crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.34,0:26:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, man, they got claws like\Na tiger if you cross them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.52,0:26:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sensabo, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.00,0:26:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.02,0:26:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But while we're all\Nhaving this little chat,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.58,0:26:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why don't you always\Nfork over your wallets?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.44,0:26:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.30,0:26:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll ask someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.64,0:27:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't realize it was getting so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.38,0:27:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I finally did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.42,0:27:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even Luffy knows about this spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.22,0:27:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.00,0:27:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I moved everything. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.36,0:27:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they poking around at the old place?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.80,0:27:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.94,0:27:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blue Jam's guys are\Nstill out looking for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.74,0:27:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.28,0:27:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, it's Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.24,0:27:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that time and he\Nstill didn't rat us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.10,0:27:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought he would since\Nhe's such an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.84,0:27:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crying whenever we left him\NBut you know what this means,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.70,0:27:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.61,0:27:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're torturing him right now
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.68,0:27:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if he still doesn't talk
Dialogue: 1,0:27:52.95,0:27:57.23,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(870,0)\pos(646,717)\3c&H1A1B1E&\c&H1A1B1E&\1a&HFF&\t(825,870,\1a&H00&)}Gray Terminal\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\NPirate{'s} Bay
Dialogue: 2,0:27:52.95,0:27:57.23,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\fad(870,0)\pos(646,717)\4a&HFF&}Gray Terminal\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\NPirate{'s} Bay
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.40,0:27:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting awful late, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.28,0:27:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who did I leave in charge today?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.92,0:28:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Captain Blue Jam, if I\Nrecall, it should be Porchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.44,0:28:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, then he'd better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.70,0:28:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, surely they made the sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.66,0:28:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It couldn't have taken him that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.72,0:28:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Porchemy thinks he's clever\Nenough to take my money and skip town.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:15.00,0:28:18.97,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(900,0)\pos(639,706)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(855,900,\1a&H00&)}{Bluejam Pirates\N\3c&H171B2D&\c&H171B2D&}Captain Bluejam\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\NBluejam Pirates
Dialogue: 2,0:28:15.00,0:28:18.97,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\fad(900,0)\pos(639,706)\4a&HFF&}{Bluejam Pirates\N}Captain Bluejam\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\NBluejam Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.24,0:28:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.92,0:28:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt he would throw his life\Naway over some measly treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.22,0:28:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.40,0:28:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.82,0:28:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.86,0:28:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.36,0:28:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Portrume, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.52,0:28:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think he's going to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.78,0:28:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's shutting down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.18,0:28:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kid's not even\Ncalling for help anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.54,0:28:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he wasn't going to talk,\Nhe would have done it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.92,0:29:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to be honest, this is\Ngetting kind of hard to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.18,0:29:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show the little bastards some mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.56,0:29:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have time to bitch about this,\Nthen you have time to go look for Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.98,0:29:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the ones who are gonna get\Nkilled here, not the damn kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.26,0:29:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save your breath,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.54,0:29:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cause you'll be begging for mercy\Nfrom Captain Blue Jam soon enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.36,0:29:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna kill that child.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.80,0:29:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think we should call\Nthe sheriff from the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.72,0:29:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.96,0:29:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, this place doesn't\Nfall under any country's laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.92,0:29:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, that portrait me guy's a\Nmember of the Blue Jam Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.38,0:29:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're paying off the nobles, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.36,0:29:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So in other words, even if they\Ndo get arrested for a crime,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.62,0:29:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're just gonna be pardoned in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.62,0:29:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, what's one more dead\Nbody in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.24,0:29:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody gives a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.16,0:29:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.78,0:29:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.26,0:29:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.86,0:30:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll beat that secret out of\Nyou or I'll beat you dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.90,0:30:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.62,0:30:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.22,0:30:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.38,0:30:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.64,0:30:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not telling you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.54,0:30:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.45,0:30:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.32,0:30:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're finished here, brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.48,0:30:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.72,0:30:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.60,0:31:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forge me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.84,0:31:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that damn kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.20,0:31:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got the money, that brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.66,0:31:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.08,0:31:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace, you're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.60,0:31:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for showing up, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.50,0:31:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved us some trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.42,0:31:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friend ain't squealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.96,0:31:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.02,0:31:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I think you'll talk. Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.60,0:31:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sabo!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.84,0:31:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.10,0:31:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.66,0:31:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.96,0:31:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sabo!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.87,0:31:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kind of hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.02,0:31:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who hit me? You?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.74,0:31:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You punks don't get who\Nyou're messing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.52,0:31:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're all dead me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.58,0:31:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.66,0:31:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sabo, help Luffy! You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.14,0:31:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One thing, that ugly dude\Nhas a sword. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.26,0:32:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.54,0:32:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Orange, that other kid got our knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.00,0:32:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, make a run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.04,0:32:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.74,0:32:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.65,0:32:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace, let's just leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.74,0:32:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't run from my enemies. Ever. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.14,0:32:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I don't go easy on\Nmy enemies. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.74,0:32:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys aren't just thugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.16,0:32:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're Blue Jam Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.52,0:32:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.54,0:32:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm done playing games here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.10,0:32:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got something that belongs to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.42,0:32:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be good and give it back you brat
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.46,0:32:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just a kid, and I don't\Nblame you for acting stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.56,0:32:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but fork over the cash or you'll regret it
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.18,0:32:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got better plans for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.02,0:32:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's our money now
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.82,0:33:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you are dead hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.46,0:33:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.88,0:33:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough of this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.36,0:33:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to lose, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.96,0:33:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather just kill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.26,0:33:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not if we do it first!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.60,0:33:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come at me, you pricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.68,0:33:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard the whole damn story, Porchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.00,0:33:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.94,0:33:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you seriously get\Nbeaten by a couple of kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.22,0:33:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.13,0:33:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.52,0:33:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The money.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.66,0:33:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.08,0:33:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not fit for my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.36,0:33:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace, that was really not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.84,0:34:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys were actual pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.04,0:34:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, we run.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.74,0:34:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever your deal is,\Nit's not worth dying over.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.52,0:34:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.64,0:34:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like my old one better.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.96,0:34:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made a huge mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.98,0:34:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pissing off pirates like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.60,0:34:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, they probably told their captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.82,0:34:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.56,0:34:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.28,0:34:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I was gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.74,0:34:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.22,0:34:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not hurt that bad,\Nso stop crying already!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.14,0:34:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When are you gonna stop being a baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.04,0:34:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you wanna be a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.90,0:34:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.00,0:34:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.10,0:34:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.10,0:34:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.36,0:34:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just happy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.34,0:34:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right. What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.28,0:34:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell them what they wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.30,0:35:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think they wouldn't kill\Nyou because you're a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.78,0:35:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys don't give a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.00,0:35:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.82,0:35:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.73,0:35:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you wouldn't be my\Nfriend. Yeah? Well, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.22,0:35:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That still beats dying, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.80,0:35:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, why do you want to be my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.88,0:35:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.44,0:35:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.35,0:35:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like I've been nice to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.16,0:35:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, I've been giving\Nyou hell ever since we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.64,0:35:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been months.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.58,0:35:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why haven't you just given up?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.80,0:35:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, cause, cause I, I\Ngot no one else to turn to?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.10,0:35:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't go back to Windmill Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.90,0:35:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like the mountain bandits either.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.00,0:35:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be all alone all the\Ntime if I didn't follow you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.24,0:35:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting beat up hurts, but\Nbeing lonely hurts more.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.56,0:35:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alone? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.52,0:35:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gramps is all I have
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.70,0:35:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You feel better around me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.02,0:35:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.68,0:36:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you feel lonely? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.14,0:36:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I think Gold Roger had a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.32,0:36:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he did, then too bad for\Nthat poor runt. No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.02,0:36:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'd put him to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.44,0:36:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd probably deserve it, too, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.96,0:36:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think I deserve to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.72,0:36:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.74,0:36:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.62,0:36:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're still annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.50,0:36:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weak little crybabies piss me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.92,0:36:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.40,0:36:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.00,0:36:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.91,0:36:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you're really strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.30,0:36:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were crying your eyes out\Nthe whole time you were tied up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.92,0:36:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you ever gotten hit\Nby a spiky thing that big?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.68,0:36:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just seven years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.22,0:36:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait till I turn ten\Nyears old like you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.56,0:36:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then I'll be stronger\Nand won't cry anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.40,0:37:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Age has nothing to do with it, you brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.64,0:37:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell, when I was seven, I was tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.66,0:37:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.57,0:37:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be so tough, you're gonna cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.38,0:37:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promised, Shanks, I'd\Nbe a great pirate someday,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.74,0:37:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that means way greater than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.34,0:37:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, you'll be a crappy pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.80,0:37:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh. Yeah, huh? Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.86,0:37:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, enough of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.72,0:37:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.66,0:37:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen, in case you guys forgot,\Nwe got a problem here. A problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.42,0:37:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This forest where I've been living\Nis awfully close to their hideout,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.90,0:37:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Cove of Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.30,0:37:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if one night I'm a little too tired,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.62,0:37:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sleep a little too hard,\Nand they sneak up on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.04,0:37:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.52,0:37:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with all the bandages?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.56,0:37:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have they been fighting\Nbears or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.12,0:38:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.32,0:38:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, boss, come quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.98,0:38:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.84,0:38:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a second, it's early.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.06,0:38:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.06,0:38:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.97,0:38:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have those brats been up to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.94,0:38:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.76,0:38:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.66,0:38:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Slave, who's that other kid with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.06,0:38:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's who now?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.82,0:38:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, two brats is already too many!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.82,0:38:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.82,0:38:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.02,0:38:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.88,0:38:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm Sabo.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.28,0:38:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.19,0:38:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace's friend, I see. Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.64,0:38:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I'm already living here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.88,0:38:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you must be Dadan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.26,0:38:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiya!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.22,0:38:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just as worthless as those\Nother two low-lifes mushing off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.06,0:38:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.97,0:38:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I heard that you're a\Nworthless old hag yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.36,0:39:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Ace! Sabo!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.20,0:39:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There aren't any free rides!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.00,0:39:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You twerps better be grateful\Nand get to work this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.70,0:39:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.10,0:39:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fearing for his life, Sabo left Gray\NTerminal and found a home with Ace and Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.30,0:39:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much to Dedan's dismay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.76,0:39:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the three unwanted guests,\Nit was a never-ending party.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.06,0:39:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Making any excuse to get\Nout of their daily chores,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.38,0:39:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they hunted wild animals in the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.74,0:39:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tussled with hooligans in the city,\Nand dueled with pirates of the cove.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.68,0:39:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Within time,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.06,0:39:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,news of their wild exploits\Nreached far and wide,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.96,0:39:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even over the high walls surrounding\Nthe center of the kingdom.

